<div class="callout"><p class="callout-t">Common claim risks in Bentonville</p><ul class="chips"><li>Large hail</li><li>Tornadoes</li><li>Ice storms</li><li>Wind</li><li>New-construction issues</li></ul></div>

<h2>Hail, wind and ice</h2>
<p>Bentonville shares Benton County’s heavy hail exposure, and spring tornado warnings are routine. Ice storms, especially the January 2009 event, damaged trees and power infrastructure across the area. Because so much of the city is new, many claims involve roofs and finishes only a few years old, where depreciation and matching disputes look different than on older homes.</p>
<h2>Neighborhoods and construction</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Downtown and the square:</strong> restored historic homes and new modern infill with flat or low-slope roofs.</li>
<li><strong>Bella Vista edge and north Bentonville:</strong> wooded lots where tree damage is common in wind and ice events.</li>
<li><strong>New subdivisions:</strong> large tracts with architectural shingles, open floor plans and builder finishes that may already be discontinued.</li>
<li><strong>Corporate and commercial growth:</strong> offices, hotels and retail with commercial policies and large roofs.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Discontinued products</h2>
<p>Fast building cycles mean shingle colors, siding profiles and flooring lines change quickly. When a damaged product can’t be matched, the repair scope often expands. We document availability so the panel can price the real repair.</p>
<h2>Appraisal services in Bentonville</h2>
<p>Every Arkansas Insurance Appraiser service is available to property owners in Bentonville and the rest of Benton County, including:</p>
<ul><li><a href="/claim-appraisal-services/appointed-appraiser-representation/">Appraisal Clause Representation</a></li><li><a href="/claim-appraisal-services/home-insurance-claim-appraiser/">Homeowner Claim Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/claim-appraisal-services/commercial-hoa-property-appraisal/">Commercial &amp; HOA Claim Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/claim-appraisal-services/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/">Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/claim-appraisal-services/tornado-wind-damage-appraisal/">Tornado &amp; Wind Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/claim-appraisal-services/hurricane-remnant-wind-appraisal/">Hurricane Remnant &amp; Tropical Storm Claims</a></li><li><a href="/claim-appraisal-services/water-damage-claim-appraiser/">Water Damage Claim Appraisal</a></li></ul>
<h2>Questions from Bentonville property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>My roof is only three years old. Will depreciation be minimal?<svg class="chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Depreciation should reflect age and condition. On a newer roof it should be modest, and we check how the carrier applied it.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can modern flat-roof homes be appraised?<svg class="chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Low-slope residential roofs are scoped like commercial membranes, with attention to insulation and drainage.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you cover Bella Vista?<svg class="chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes, along with all of Benton County.</p></div></details></div>
